#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ksnapshot; may be started by one of several ways as described below."
msgstr "Ksnapshot អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​ចាប់ផ្ដើម​ដោយ​វិធី​មួយ​ដូច​ដែល​បាន​ពណ៌នា​ខាងក្រោម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You may start &ksnapshot; by selecting it from the <menuchoice> "
#| "<guimenu>K-Menu</guimenu><guisubmenu>Graphics</guisubmenu> "
#| "<guimenuitem>&ksnapshot; (Screen Capture Program)</guimenuitem></"
#| "menuchoice>."
